{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"d588d852998265b3c8bfcfd2300e916367f4622e0438651754e56a5eb79ba847","digest":{"component_or_area":"LLM workflow completion recovery","key_entities":["CompletionAgentStep.run","src/rebar/llm/workflow/completion_recovery.py","src/rebar/llm/structured_run.py","src/rebar/llm/errors.py","LLMBudgetExhaustedError","interpret_failure","UnretryableOutputError","LLMRunnerError","_recover","failure_diagnostic"],"problem_keywords":["bounded completion recovery","step-budget exhaustion","LLMRunnerError","UnretryableOutputError","exception routing","unreachable code path"],"propositions":["LLMRunnerError raised from step-budget exhaustion does not match the except UnretryableOutputError clause in CompletionAgentStep.run, preventing bounded recovery from engaging","A new LLMBudgetExhaustedError subclass of LLMRunnerError must be created and raised by interpret_failure's budget branch to make budget exhaustion identifiable by type","The except clause in CompletionAgentStep.run must be extended to catch LLMBudgetExhaustedError and route it to _recover for bounded per-criterion recovery","When recovery fails after catching LLMBudgetExhaustedError, the original budget diagnostic must be preserved on failure_diagnostic for proper error surfacing","Plain LLMRunnerError instances that are not LLMBudgetExhaustedError must continue to propagate unchanged to maintain backward compatibility"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787495915722469001,"uuid":"c5ebccf8-0170-45e1-acfa-96cb22673cee"}